# FOLIAGE-COLLISION: foliage instances collide per foliage cell (ECS::FoliageCollision -> PhysicsWorld::CreateInstancedStaticBody,
# one static compound body per field = per type per WP cell). GameplayProof.desce: the pawn spawns at PlayerStart (0, 92, 650)
# and W walks it along -Z. Two types from Content/Foliage/Proof: FC_TreeBlocks (island_tree_01 x2.8, Collision on, BlockAll, Mesh)
# and FC_BushPasses (shrub_02 x1.3, Collision off). Single tool + "Stroke at viewport centre" with the camera straight down
# places one instance exactly under the centre. GameplayProof.lua labels the pawn's position over its head.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/GameplayProof.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Foliage "Add type to the palette: FC_TreeBlocks"
Дано run Foliage "Tool: Single"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,1500,350
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,-0.01
Дано run Foliage "Stroke at viewport centre"
Дано run Foliage "Add type to the palette: FC_BushPasses"
Дано run Foliage "Palette: edit FC_TreeBlocks"
Дано run Foliage "Edited type: toggle checked (paint with it)"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 600,1500,350
Дано run Foliage "Stroke at viewport centre"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,600,1300
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.4,-1
Тогда-вид 0_layout a tree on the pawn's path at (0, 350) and a shrub at (600, 350); the white PlayerStart beyond them
# [1_blocked] walk forward 3 s: the pawn stops at the trunk.
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 0.5
Когда input keydown - - w
Когда advance 3.0
Когда input keyup - - w
Когда advance 0.3
Тогда-вид 1_blocked the pawn line reads z about 350 + trunk radius + capsule radius (well above 0), "on ground"; the pawn stands at the trunk, not past it
# [2_bushes] strafe right to x 600 and walk forward through the shrub (Collision off).
Когда input keydown - - d
Когда advance 1.2
Когда input keyup - - d
Когда input keydown - - w
Когда advance 2.0
Когда input keyup - - w
Когда advance 0.3
Тогда-вид 2_bushes the pawn line reads z below 200 (past the shrub row at 350); the shrub behind the pawn
Когда run Action "Stop"
# [3_paint_undo] paint a second tree on the shrub's lane, Play: blocked at it; undo the stroke, Play: passes.
Когда run Foliage "Palette: edit FC_BushPasses"
Когда run Foliage "Edited type: toggle checked (paint with it)"
Когда run Foliage "Palette: edit FC_TreeBlocks"
Когда run Foliage "Edited type: toggle checked (paint with it)"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 600,1500,250
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,-0.01
Когда run Foliage "Stroke at viewport centre"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 0.5
Когда input keydown - - d
Когда advance 1.2
Когда input keyup - - d
Когда input keydown - - w
Когда advance 2.0
Когда input keyup - - w
Когда advance 0.3
Тогда-вид 3a_painted_blocks the pawn line reads z above 250 at x about 600: the painted tree stops it
Когда run Action "Stop"
Когда run Edit "Undo"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 0.5
Когда input keydown - - d
Когда advance 1.2
Когда input keyup - - d
Когда input keydown - - w
Когда advance 2.0
Когда input keyup - - w
Когда advance 0.3
Тогда-вид 3b_undo_passes the pawn line reads z below 200 at x about 600: the undone tree no longer blocks; editor.log errors 0
Когда run Action "Stop"
